WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,750 --> 00:00:01,870
Su Wanwan

2
00:00:02,590 --> 00:00:05,350
Let’s talk about Captain Wu again

3
00:00:05,510 --> 00:00:06,710
You are not so thick

4
00:00:07,030 --> 00:00:08,430
Wanwande just promised me

5
00:00:08,430 --> 00:00:10,270
It's business to have lunch with me

6
00:00:12,030 --> 00:00:13,310
Na Wanwan

7
00:00:13,430 --> 00:00:16,970
Let's have dinner together tonight, Captain Wu

8
00:00:17,090 --> 00:00:18,130
What's the matter?

9
00:00:18,330 --> 00:00:19,490
you know

10
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:20,960
Ji Chuan?

11
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:22,200
Why would he mention Ji Chuan?

12
00:00:22,360 --> 00:00:23,960
I said my whole family was killed by monsters

13
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:25,680
If the organization knew that Ji Chuan was only targeting me

14
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:27,040
He will definitely not help me conquer him.

15
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:29,750
You can never admit that you don’t know him

16
00:00:30,070 --> 00:00:31,300
Don't know

17
00:00:31,580 --> 00:00:33,460
Why did you accept the transfer from Ji Chuan for two years?

18
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:34,580
Surprised by transfer

19
00:00:34,740 --> 00:00:36,740
But it covers everything in your daily life

20
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:39,100
Didn't tell the truth at all

21
00:00:39,260 --> 00:00:40,660
There is definitely a huge inside story here

22
00:00:40,660 --> 00:00:43,900
Is the monster you are facing Ji Chuan your parents?

23
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:44,940
Did he really kill him?
